tracing with nativeTraceImage**\"}]}"}, {"type": "text", "text": "The first registration alone is not enough. The trace image intentionally excludes the coordinate’s own metadata during collection, so I’m rebuilding it without exact-metadata exit mode and running the same trace runtime arguments. This should expose the complete application exception chain and collect the registrations that the exact-mode formatter currently obscures with its secondary stack overflow.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0b14dd35863987f1016ab914f69fa087d29cb7af71b6081fdc\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"}, {"type": "toolCall", "id": "call_wecgwb2RBFcqlVYA5In3PZ89|fc_0b14dd35863987f1016ab914f8493887d2ac726cdacee2ba8a", "name": "bash", "arguments": {"command": "export GRAALVM_HOME=/home/oracle/oracle/graal/sdk/mxbuild/linux-amd64/GRAALVM_NI_EE_JAVA25/graalvm-ni-ee-25.4.4.1.1-dev+1.1\nexport JAVA_HOME=/home/oracle/oracle/graal/sdk/mxbuild/linux-amd64/GRAALVM_NI_EE_JAVA25/graalvm-ni-ee-25.4.4.1.1-dev+1.1\n./gradlew nativeTraceImage -Pcoordinates=org.hibernate:hibernate-spatial:8.0.0.Beta1 > /tmp/hibernate-spatial-nativeTraceImage-nonexact.log 2>&1 || { tail -200 /tmp/hibernate-spatial-nativeTraceImage-nonexact.log; exit 1; }\ncd tests/src/org.hibernate/hibernate-spatial/8.0.0.Beta1\nrm -rf build/natively-collected/runs/nonexact test-results-native/test\nmkdir -p build/natively-collected/runs/nonexact\nbinary=\"$PWD/build/native/nativeTestCompile/org.hibernate.hibernate-spatial_tests-tests\"\n\"$binary\" '-Djunit.jupiter.execution.timeout.default=60 s' -Djunit.jupiter.execution.timeout.mode=enabled -Djunit.jupiter.execution.timeout.thread.mode.default=separate_thread -XX:TraceMetadata=\"path=$PWD/build/natively-collected/runs/nonexact\" -XX:TraceMetadataConditionPackages=org.hibernate > /tmp/hibernate-spatial-nonexact-run.log 2>&1\nstatus=$?\necho \"exit=$status\"\ncat /tmp/hibernate-spatial-nonexact-run.log\nprintf '\\nTrace:\\n'\ncat build/natively-collected/runs/nonexact/reachability-metadata.json\nprintf '\\nNative XML exceptions:\\n'\nrg -n -C 3 'error type|Caused by:' test-results-native/test -g '*.xml' || true\nexit 0", "timeout": 1200}}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 4330, "output": 1349, "cacheRead": 97536, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 841, "totalTokens": 103215, "cost": {"input": 0.01732, "output": 0.02698, "cacheRead": 0.039014400000000005, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.08331440000000001}}, "stopReason": "toolUse", "timestamp": 1790514394465, "responseId": "resp_0b14dd35863987f1016ab914dab81887d28e726d0ce87bb327", "rawStopReason": "completed"}}
